# Phaser UI Component Standards

## Description

Establishes standards for creating reusable, maintainable UI components in Phaser games with a focus on rapid prototyping and iteration.

## Rule

1. UI Component Structure:
   - MUST extend base UI component class:

     ```typescript
     export abstract class UIComponent extends Phaser.GameObjects.Container {
       protected scene: Phaser.Scene;
       
       constructor(scene: Phaser.Scene, x: number, y: number) {
         super(scene, x, y);
         this.scene = scene;
         this.init();
       }
       
       protected abstract init(): void;
       public abstract update(): void;
       public abstract destroy(): void;
     }
     ```

2. Common Components:
   - MUST implement standard UI components:

     ```typescript
     export class Button extends UIComponent {
       static create(scene: Phaser.Scene, x: number, y: number, text: string): Button;
     }
     
     export class ProgressBar extends UIComponent {
       static create(scene: Phaser.Scene, x: number, y: number, width: number): ProgressBar;
     }
     
     export class Dialog extends UIComponent {
       static show(scene: Phaser.Scene, text: string, options?: DialogOptions): Dialog;
     }
     ```

3. Layout Management:
   - MUST provide layout utilities:

     ```typescript
     export class UILayout {
       static grid(items: UIComponent[], cols: number, padding: number): void;
       static stack(items: UIComponent[], spacing: number, vertical?: boolean): void;
       static center(item: UIComponent): void;
     }
     ```

4. Theme System:
   - MUST use centralized theme configuration:

     ```typescript
     export const UITheme = {
       colors: {
         primary: 0x4a90e2,
         secondary: 0x50e3c2,
         background: 0x2c3e50
       },
       fonts: {
         default: 'Arial',
         title: 'GameFont'
       },
       sizes: {
         small: 12,
         medium: 16,
         large: 24
       }
     } as const;
     ```

5. Rapid Prototyping:
   - MUST provide quick UI creation methods:

     ```typescript
     export class UIFactory {
       static quickMenu(scene: Phaser.Scene, items: string[]): Menu;
       static quickDialog(scene: Phaser.Scene, text: string): Dialog;
       static quickHUD(scene: Phaser.Scene): HUD;
     }
     ```

